[00:16.14] I will fight, will fight with my heart
[00:21.26] I will fight, will fight with understanding
[00:30.40] In my mind, the weather never changes
[00:38.08] Skill overcomes, unfavorable conditions
[00:45.62] A straight line exists between me and the good things
[00:54.12] I have found the line and its direction is known to me
[01:01.24] Absolute trust keeps me going in the right direction
[01:08.88] Any intrusion is met with a heart full of the good thing
[01:15.08] Try to compare what I am presenting
[01:23.66] You will meet with much frustration
